  "notes": "USAGE: {開会|かいかい} is used for formal beginnings of meetings, assemblies, and events.\n\nCOMMON COMPOUNDS:\n・{開会|かいかい}{式|しき} (opening ceremony)\n・{開会|かいかい}の{辞|じ}/{挨拶|あいさつ} (opening address/remarks)\n・{開会|かいかい}を{宣言|せんげん}する (to declare the opening)\n・{開会|かいかい}{時間|じかん} (opening time)\n\nPOLITICAL USE:\n・{国会|こっかい}の{開会|かいかい} (opening of the Diet/Parliament)\n・{開会|かいかい}{中|ちゅう} (while in session)\n\nCONTRAST:\n・{閉会|へいかい} - closing (of a meeting) - opposite",
